        "text": "Step 1: Analyze the function $f(x) = |x - p| + |x - 15| + |x - p - 15|$ within the interval $p \\leq x \\leq 15$."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 287,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 288,
        "char_start": 113,
        "effective_step": 2,
