        "prefix_token_count": 124,
        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: Since $0 < p < 15$, we know that $p < 15$. Therefore, within the interval $p \\leq x \\leq 15$, the term $|x - p - 15|$ will always be positive because $x - p - 15 < 0$."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 488,
