        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: Within the interval $p \\leq x \\leq 15$, the terms $|x - p|$ and $|x - 15|$ can be simplified to $x - p$ and $15 - x$ respectively, since both $x - p \\geq 0$ and $15 - x \\geq 0$ in this range."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 624,
