        "effective_step": 4,
        "end_token_index": 265,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 266,
        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Substitute these simplified expressions into $f(x)$ to get $f(x) = (x - p) + (15 - x) + |x - p - 15| = 15 - p + |x - p - 15|$."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 758,
