        "prefix_token_count": 326,
        "step_number": 5,
        "text": "Step 5: Notice that when $p \\leq x \\leq 15$, the term $|x - p - 15|$ simplifies further to $15 - x - p$ because $x - p - 15 \\leq 0$."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 819,
